      "title": "Small, but not good speaker quality for music",
      "review_text": "[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I received the Emerson ER-700 Portable AM/FM Radio with Built-in Speaker via Influenster for my honest review. The unit itself measures 3 1/2” tall, and 10 1/2” tall with the antenna fully extended. It is just over 2 1/4” wide, and also includes a convenient belt clip, and takes two AA batteries to operate. Controls are simple with an AM and FM option as well as tuning and volume, and an outlet to connect wired headphones. I sampled both AM and FM stations and found the speaker quality rather raspy and poor quality no matter what stations I sampled. The speaker particularly sounded poor quality when listening to music stations, however talk radio stations seemed to project more clearly. This is definitely a handy little portable radio if you don't mind the marginal speaker quality.",
